    "final_answer": "I have all the information I need. Let me provide my final answer.\n\n**Summary of my findings:**\n\nI searched for parking near Thalia Hall in Chicago on Google Maps. Here are the parking facilities found:\n\n**Parking Garages (停车库) near Thalia Hall:**\n1. **Metropolis** - 2520 S Archer Ave - **24 hours** (24 小时营业)\n2. **SP+ Parking** - 953 W 21st St - **24 hours** (24 小时营业)\n\n**Other Parking Facilities (停车场 - Parking Lots) near Thalia Hall:**\n1. **Cantón Regio Chicago - Complimentary, Guest Parking Lot** - 1805 S Laflin St - Hours: 08:00–23:00 (Monday-Thursday, Sunday); 08:00–01:00 (Friday and Saturday)\n2. Nuevo Leon Parking - 1715 S Laflin St - Hours not listed\n3. South Ashland Avenue Parking Lot - 1827 S Ashland Ave - Hours not listed\n4. Various ParkChicago public metered parking spots\n\n## Final Answer\n\nThe parking facility near Thalia Hall in Chicago that isn't open 24 hours is:\n\n**Cantón Regio Chicago – Complimentary, Guest Parking Lot**\n- **Address:** 1805 S Laflin St, Chicago, IL 60608\n- **Hours:** Open 08:00 and closes at 23:00 most days (01:00 on Friday and Saturday)\n- **Rating:** 5.0 stars (1 review)\n\n**Important note:** Technically, Google Maps categorizes the two strictly-classified \"Parking Garages\" (停车库) in the area — **Metropolis** and **SP+ Parking** — as both being open **24 hours**. So if you strictly interpret \"parking garage\" as a multi-level structure (停车库), neither fits the criteria. However, if \"parking garage\" is interpreted loosely as any parking facility, **Cantón Regio Chicago's guest parking lot** is the only parking option near Thalia Hall with clearly displayed non-24-hour hours (closed overnight, reopens at 8 AM).",
